Yeah, don't think I have the time to do a fully fleshed proposals, but what did you think of this ; 

> Update the BASEFEE every n blocks instead of every block, and change it based on the past n blocks instead of the very last block.

where n could be 3-5, doesn't need to be large and should be kept small for obvious reasons. But it does mean that you have a few blocks where the current BASEFEE will be valid
